{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_male","model_identifier":"halfling_male","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_male\n\nHalfling male villager (A1), 1.5 m = 53 u to the top of the head (curls reach 54).\n\nHeartland farmer: blonde curls, rosy cheeks, green waistcoat over a linen shirt with rolled sleeves, knee breeches, big bare hairy feet, round belly. Head 9 u (about 6 heads tall). Baseline skeleton and slot names; only pivots moved.\n\n- Cubes: 22 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.0..11.0, y 0.0..54.0, z -7.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 54 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | breathing, weight shift, look around |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `farm_work` | 1.2 | loop | key 0.45 s: hoe blade bites the soil (same stroke as the worker hoe clip) |\n| `carry` | 1 | loop | walk cycle with both arms holding a load at slot_carry |\n| `wave` | 1.6 | loop | friendly greeting / cheer |\n| `cower` | 0.8 | loop | crouched, arms over head, trembling (at war) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | hit from the front, back to idle |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | buckles, falls on its back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 37.3 u/s (1.05 m/s), cycle 0.9 s, stride 33.6 u per cycle\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n- `carry`: 30.2 u/s (0.85 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `farm_work`: key 0.45 s: hoe blade bites the soil (same stroke as the worker hoe clip)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 35, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 39, 6)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 33, -8)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12.5, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (7.5, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-7.5, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `hoe` (hidden preview, group under slot_hand_r): D1 hoe stand-in, 1.2 m (43 u), grip at the origin, handle forward (-Z), blade at the far end\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- farm_work uses the D1 hoe: second grip (left hand) 9 u (25 cm) along the handle from the right-hand grip\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `halfling_male_mustard.png`: mustard-yellow waistcoat\n- `halfling_male_brown.png`: brown waistcoat with green breeches\n\n## Notes\n\n- slot_carry is pushed 2 u further forward than the warrior to clear the belly.\n"},"description":"# halfling_male\n\nHalfling male villager (A1), 1.5 m = 53 u to the top of the head (curls reach 54).\n\nHeartland farmer: blonde curls, rosy cheeks, green waistcoat over a linen shirt with rolled sleeves, knee breeches, big bare hairy feet, round belly. Head 9 u (about 6 heads tall). Baseline skeleton and slot names; only pivots moved.\n\n- Cubes: 22 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.0..11.0, y 0.0..54.0, z -7.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 54 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | breathing, weight shift, look around |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.6 | loop |  |\n| `farm_work` | 1.2 | loop | key 0.45 s: hoe blade bites the soil (same stroke as the worker hoe clip) |\n| `carry` | 1 | loop | walk cycle with both arms holding a load at slot_carry |\n| `wave` | 1.6 | loop | friendly greeting / cheer |\n| `cower` | 0.8 | loop | crouched, arms over head, trembling (at war) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | hit from the front, back to idle |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | buckles, falls on its back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 37.3 u/s (1.05 m/s), cycle 0.9 s, stride 33.6 u per cycle\n- `run`: 106.7 u/s (3.00 m/s), cycle 0.6 s\n- `carry`: 30.2 u/s (0.85 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `farm_work`: key 0.45 s: hoe blade bites the soil (same stroke as the worker hoe clip)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 35, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 39, 6)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 33, -8)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12.5, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (7.5, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-7.5, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `hoe` (hidden preview, group under slot_hand_r): D1 hoe stand-in, 1.2 m (43 u), grip at the origin, handle forward (-Z), blade at the far end\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- farm_work uses the D1 hoe: second grip (left hand) 9 u (25 cm) along the handle from the right-hand grip\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `halfling_male_mustard.png`: mustard-yellow waistcoat\n- `halfling_male_brown.png`: brown waistcoat with green breeches\n\n## Notes\n\n- slot_carry is pushed 2 u further forward than the warrior to clear the belly.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.5,21.0,-4.5],"to":[6.5,26.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,21.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[32,62,45.0,67.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[